@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Login -> access token (saved by the HTTP client as `login`)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "user@booking.local", "password": "user-password-123"}

### Use the token
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Create a booking with the token
POST {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000002", "startTime": "2026-10-09T13:00:00Z", "endTime": "2026-10-09T14:00:00Z"}

### My bookings
GET {{base}}/users/me/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Invalid token -> 401, WWW-Authenticate: Bearer error="invalid_token"
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer not.a.token

### No token -> 401, WWW-Authenticate: Bearer realm="room-booking"
GET {{base}}/users/me
